item | Save Current View As a New View... | save | view.saveViewAs | | S
item | Apply Current View to Other Calendar Folders... | | view.applyViewTo | | A

menu timeScale
item | 60 Minutes | | calendar.timeScale | {"minutes":60} | 6 | on=mem:timeScale.60
